            <p style="font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #3A2E27; margin-bottom: 0;">Food-grade platinum silicone is soft, resilient, and baby-tough. Formulated from natural silica elements, it provides the ideal balance of gentle flexibility to comfort tender gums without sacrificing durability. From cooling teethers to rattles, silicone is non-porous, naturally hygienic, and effortless to clean.</p>
