      <div class="safety-text-body">
        <p style="font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #3A2E27; margin-bottom: 12px;">You might notice a subtle "fresh" scent when unboxing your new Little Creation products. This is completely normal, harmless, and safe.</p>
        <p style="font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #3A2E27; margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong style="font-weight: 700; color: #111;">The Science:</strong> Our 100% Platinum Silicone is cured at high temperatures during manufacturing. Because items are hygienically sealed immediately after cooling to protect them during transit, natural warm air can remain trapped inside the airtight package.</p>
        <p style="font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #3A2E27; margin-bottom: 0;">This is <em>not</em> toxic chemical off-gassing. It is simply trapped air from the thermal stabilization process.</p>
      </div>

