          <p style="font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.7; color: #3A2E27; margin-bottom: 8px;"><strong style="font-weight: 700; color: #111;">🌬️ Air Dry:</strong> Allow it to air dry completely in a clean, ventilated area.</p>
          <p style="font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.7; color: #3A2E27; margin-bottom: 0;">The gentle heat allows any residual trapped moisture to evaporate, leaving pure, completely odorless silicone.</p>
